# M2.3 Native ProGen3D module. mm -> m in Start. Factory-CAD geometry only.
# All five modules share one rail-centred frame. Travel is illustrative, not a physical limit-switch measurement.
# Wheel rotation and pulley transmission are kinematic approximations; belt shape is static CAD reference.
Start -> [ S(.001 .001 .001) M23Controls ]
M23Controls ->
R TravelMM(0 0)
R Animate(1 1)
R CycleSeconds(8 8)
R Explode(0 0)
M23Assembly(max(-110,min(110,(1-Animate)*TravelMM+Animate*110*sin(6.283185307179586*t/CycleSeconds))) Explode)

